 "h": "Competition ratios",
 "b": "<p>Applications per post in England (round 1 CT1, includes ACCS Anaesthetics; round 2 ST3, then ST4). Hover over a point for the numbers, or open the table below.</p><div class=\"crlegend\"><span><i class=\"crk1\"></i>CT1</span><span><i class=\"crk2\"></i>ST4</span><span><i class=\"crk2o\"></i>ST3 (until 2021)</span></div><svg viewBox=\"0 0 340 210\" class=\"crsvg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Anaesthetics competition ratios 2019 to 2025: CT1 rose from 2.4 to 12.6 applications per post; ST3 then ST4 stayed between 1.5 and 2.7\"><line x1=\"30\" x2=\"262\" y1=\"184.0\" y2=\"184.0\" class=\"crg\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"187.5\" class=\"crt\" text-anchor=\"end\">0</text><line x1=\"30\" x2=\"262\" y1=\"134.9\" y2=\"134.9\" class=\"crg\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"138.4\" class=\"crt\" text-anchor=\"end\">4</text><line x1=\"30\" x2=\"262\" y1=\"85.7\" y2=\"85.7\" class=\"crg\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"89.2\" class=\"crt\" text-anchor=\"end\">8</text><line x1=\"30\" x2=\"262\" y1=\"36.6\" y2=\"36.6\" class=\"crg\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"40.1\" class=\"crt\" text-anchor=\"end\">12</text><text x=\"30.0\" y=\"202\" class=\"crt\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2019</text><text x=\"68.7\" y=\"202\" class=\"crt\" text-anchor=\"middle\">20</text><text x=\"107.3\" y=\"202\" class=\"crt\" text-anchor=\"middle\">21</text><text x=\"146.0\" y=\"202\" class=\"crt\" text-anchor=\"middle\">22</text><text x=\"184.7\" y=\"202\" class=\"crt\" text-anchor=\"middle\">23</text><text x=\"223.3\" y=\"202\" class=\"crt\" text-anchor=\"middle\">24</text><text x=\"262.0\" y=\"202\" class=\"crt\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2025</text><path d=\"M30.0 155.2 L68.7 152.1 L107.3 139.6 L146.0 132.5 L184.7 125.3 L223.3 104.2 L262.0 29.7\" class=\"crl1\"/><path d=\"M30.0 165.3 L68.7 157.6 L107.3 151.2\" class=\"crl2\"/><path d=\"M184.7 164.3 L223.3 163.9 L262.0 163.7\" class=\"crl2\"/><g class=\"crp\"><circle cx=\"30.0\" cy=\"155.2\" r=\"12\" class=\"crh\"/><circle cx=\"30.0\" cy=\"155.2\" r=\"4\" class=\"crm1\"/><title>CT1 2019: 1,333 applications for 568 posts = 2.35:1</title></g><g class=\"crp\"><circle cx=\"68.7\" cy=\"152.1\" r=\"12\" class=\"crh\"/><circle cx=\"68.7\" cy=\"152.1\" r=\"4\" class=\"crm1\"/><title>CT1 2020: 1,479 applications for 569 posts = 2.60:1</title></g><g class=\"crp\"><circle cx=\"107.3\" cy=\"139.6\" r=\"12\" class=\"crh\"/><circle cx=\"107.3\" cy=\"139.6\" r=\"4\" class=\"crm1\"/><title>CT1 2021: 2,046 applications for 566 posts = 3.61:1</title></g><g class=\"crp\"><circle cx=\"146.0\" cy=\"132.5\" r=\"12\" class=\"crh\"/><circle cx=\"146.0\" cy=\"132.5\" r=\"4\" class=\"crm1\"/><title>CT1 2022: 2,337 applications for 558 posts = 4.19:1</title></g><g class=\"crp\"><circle cx=\"184.7\" cy=\"125.3\" r=\"12\" class=\"crh\"/><circle cx=\"184.7\" cy=\"125.3\" r=\"4\" class=\"crm1\"/><title>CT1 2023: 2,604 applications for 545 posts = 4.78:1</title></g><g class=\"crp\"><circle cx=\"223.3\" cy=\"104.2\" r=\"12\" class=\"crh\"/><circle cx=\"223.3\" cy=\"104.2\" r=\"4\" class=\"crm1\"/><title>CT1 2024: 3,522 applications for 542 posts = 6.50:1</title></g><g class=\"crp\"><circle cx=\"262.0\" cy=\"29.7\" r=\"12\" class=\"crh\"/><circle cx=\"262.0\" cy=\"29.7\" r=\"4\" class=\"crm1\"/><title>CT1 2025: 6,770 applications for 539 posts = 12.56:1</title></g><g class=\"crp\"><circle cx=\"30.0\" cy=\"165.3\" r=\"12\" class=\"crh\"/><circle cx=\"30.0\" cy=\"165.3\" r=\"4\" class=\"crm2o\"/><title>ST3 2019: 575 applications for 377 posts = 1.53:1</title></g><g class=\"crp\"><circle cx=\"68.7\" cy=\"157.6\" r=\"12\" class=\"crh\"/><circle cx=\"68.7\" cy=\"157.6\" r=\"4\" class=\"crm2o\"/><title>ST3 2020: 758 applications for 353 posts = 2.15:1</title></g><g class=\"crp\"><circle cx=\"107.3\" cy=\"151.2\" r=\"12\" class=\"crh\"/><circle cx=\"107.3\" cy=\"151.2\" r=\"4\" class=\"crm2o\"/><title>ST3 2021: 1,056 applications for 396 posts = 2.67:1</title></g><g class=\"crp\"><circle cx=\"184.7\" cy=\"164.3\" r=\"12\" class=\"crh\"/><circle cx=\"184.7\" cy=\"164.3\" r=\"4\" class=\"crm2\"/><title>ST4 2023: 640 applications for 399 posts = 1.60:1</title></g><g class=\"crp\"><circle cx=\"223.3\" cy=\"163.9\" r=\"12\" class=\"crh\"/><circle cx=\"223.3\" cy=\"163.9\" r=\"4\" class=\"crm2\"/><title>ST4 2024: 640 applications for 391 posts = 1.64:1</title></g><g class=\"crp\"><circle cx=\"262.0\" cy=\"163.7\" r=\"12\" class=\"crh\"/><circle cx=\"262.0\" cy=\"163.7\" r=\"4\" class=\"crm2\"/><title>ST4 2025: 699 applications for 423 posts = 1.65:1</title></g><text x=\"270\" y=\"33.7\" class=\"crd\">CT1 12.6:1</text><text x=\"270\" y=\"167.7\" class=\"crd\">ST4 1.65:1</text></svg><div class=\"crstats\"><div><b>12.6:1</b><span>CT1 2025<br>6,770 for 539 posts</span></div><div><b>1.65:1</b><span>ST4 2025<br>699 for 423 posts</span></div><div><b>52%</b><span>of departments advertising a consultant post could not appoint (2020)</span></div></div><p><b>Consultant posts:</b> no national competition ratio is published. In the RCoA 2020 census, 103 of 198 departments that advertised could not appoint, and 278 consultant jobs went unfilled, mostly for lack of (suitable) applicants. The bottleneck is getting into training, not the consultant job at the end.</p><details class=\"crtab\"><summary>Show the numbers as a table</summary><table class=\"rtab\"><tr><th>Year</th><th>CT1</th><th>ST3/ST4</th></tr><tr><td>2019</td><td>1,333 / 568 = <b>2.35</b></td><td>ST3: 575 / 377 = <b>1.53</b></td></tr><tr><td>2020</td><td>1,479 / 569 = <b>2.60</b></td><td>ST3: 758 / 353 = <b>2.15</b></td></tr><tr><td>2021</td><td>2,046 / 566 = <b>3.61</b></td><td>ST3: 1,056 / 396 = <b>2.67</b></td></tr><tr><td>2022</td><td>2,337 / 558 = <b>4.19</b></td><td>Not published (ST3 to ST4 change)</td></tr><tr><td>2023</td><td>2,604 / 545 = <b>4.78</b></td><td>ST4: 640 / 399 = <b>1.60</b></td></tr><tr><td>2024</td><td>3,522 / 542 = <b>6.50</b></td><td>ST4: 640 / 391 = <b>1.64</b></td></tr><tr><td>2025</td><td>6,770 / 539 = <b>12.56</b></td><td>ST4: 699 / 423 = <b>1.65</b></td></tr></table></details><p class=\"muted\">Ratios count applications, not unique applicants, and are for England. Sources: <a href=\"https://medical.hee.nhs.uk/medical-training-recruitment/medical-specialty-training/competition-ratios\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">NHS England competition ratios ↗</a>; <a href=\"https://www.rcoa.ac.uk/sites/default/files/documents/2020-11/Medical-Workforce-Census-Report-2020.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">RCoA Medical Workforce Census 2020 ↗</a>.</p>"
